{
  "file": "module3",
  "page": 167,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        68.93421936035156,
        206.8942413330078,
        85.31422424316406
      ],
      "text": "Priority of a problem",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        95.56519317626953,
        526.9151000976562,
        108.71018981933594
      ],
      "text": "The GDG considers whether the overall consequences of a problem (e.g. increased morbidity,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        111.06519317626953,
        526.9546508789062,
        124.21018981933594
      ],
      "text": "mortality and economic effects) are serious and urgent. The global situation is considered",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        126.56519317626953,
        527.2451171875,
        139.71018981933594
      ],
      "text": "and available data reviewed. In most cases, the problem must be serious and urgent to be",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        142.065185546875,
        176.28900146484375,
        155.21018981933594
      ],
      "text": "considered by a GDG.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        167.57679748535156,
        156.35850524902344,
        183.95680236816406
      ],
      "text": "Test accuracy",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        194.20782470703125,
        526.9954223632812,
        207.3528289794922
      ],
      "text": "The pooled sensitivity and specificity presented in the GRADE evidence profile is assessed.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        209.70782470703125,
        526.7938842773438,
        222.8528289794922
      ],
      "text": "Preferably and if available the review includes studies with both microbiological reference",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        225.20782470703125,
        526.980712890625,
        238.3528289794922
      ],
      "text": "standards (culture) as well as composite reference standards (e.g. in children and in patients",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        240.70782470703125,
        194.80140686035156,
        253.8528289794922
      ],
      "text": "with extrapulmonary TB).",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        266.2193298339844,
        402.3398132324219,
        282.59930419921875
      ],
      "text": "Balance between desirable and undesirable effects",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        292.8502197265625,
        526.96337890625,
        305.9952392578125
      ],
      "text": "Under this component, GDG members are asked to judge the anticipated benefits and harms",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        308.3502197265625,
        526.686279296875,
        321.4952392578125
      ],
      "text": "from the test in question, including direct effects of the test (e.g. benefits such as faster",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        323.8502197265625,
        526.96337890625,
        336.9952392578125
      ],
      "text": "diagnosis, and harms such as adverse effects from administration of the test). In addition, the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        339.3502197265625,
        526.7202758789062,
        352.4952392578125
      ],
      "text": "possible subsequent effects of the test must be included; for instance, effects of treatment",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        354.8502197265625,
        526.6566162109375,
        367.9952392578125
      ],
      "text": "after a positive diagnosis (cure or decrease in mortality), and the effect of no treatment or",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        370.3502197265625,
        526.9369506835938,
        383.4952392578125
      ],
      "text": "further testing after a negative test result. Evidence, ideally retrieved from systematic reviews",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        385.8502197265625,
        527.1903686523438,
        398.9952392578125
      ],
      "text": "of randomized controlled trials (RCTs) of the test, should inform the GDG of these downstream",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.980833053588867,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        401.3502197265625,
        526.9667358398438,
        414.4952392578125
      ],
      "text": "effects. If evidence from RCTs is not available, diagnostic accuracy studies can be used. In the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        416.8502197265625,
        526.8203125,
        429.9952392578125
      ],
      "text": "latter, true positive and true negative diagnosed cases are taken as benefits, whereas false",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        432.3502197265625,
        326.3812255859375,
        445.4952392578125
      ],
      "text": "positive and false negative cases are taken as harms.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        457.86181640625,
        235.93875122070312,
        474.2417907714844
      ],
      "text": "Certainty of the evidence",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        484.4927978515625,
        527.0140380859375,
        497.6378173828125
      ],
      "text": "Certainty of the evidence of test accuracy is judged scored on a scale from very low, via low",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        499.9927978515625,
        526.9623413085938,
        513.1378173828125
      ],
      "text": "and moderate, to high. Certainty of the evidence on direct benefits and harms from the test",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        515.4927978515625,
        267.7196960449219,
        528.6378173828125
      ],
      "text": "are assessed and scored in a similar way.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        541.0043334960938,
        240.52088928222656,
        557.3843383789062
      ],
      "text": "Certainty of management",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        567.6353149414062,
        526.6840209960938,
        580.7803344726562
      ],
      "text": "For certainty of patient management being guided by the test results, the GDG focuses on",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        583.1353149414062,
        506.10760498046875,
        596.2803344726562
      ],
      "text": "whether the management would be any different, should it be guided by the test results.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        607.1392211914062,
        527.3148803710938,
        620.2842407226562
      ],
      "text": "For certainty of the link between test results and management, the panel assesses how quickly",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.989194869995117,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        622.6392211914062,
        390.2243957519531,
        635.7842407226562
      ],
      "text": "and effectively test results can transfer to management decisions.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        648.1508178710938,
        445.62640380859375,
        664.5308227539062
      ],
      "text": "Confidence in values and preferences and their variability",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        674.78173828125,
        527.046630859375,
        687.9267578125
      ],
      "text": "The value of the test to improve diagnosis and its impact on patient care is evaluated and scored",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.95229721069336,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        690.28173828125,
        526.9647827148438,
        703.4267578125
      ],
      "text": "with the help of evidence from qualitative research. The impact on notification and, moreover,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.987993240356445,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        705.78173828125,
        526.955078125,
        718.9267578125
      ],
      "text": "the ability of the test to increase case notification is also evaluated and scored, taking into",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        721.28173828125,
        526.9656982421875,
        734.4267578125
      ],
      "text": "account the entire diagnostic cascade, including, for example, issues related to feasibility of",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        736.78173828125,
        520.7809448242188,
        749.9267578125
      ],
      "text": "implementation, rate of use, staff’s confidence in test results and turnaround time of results.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        373.5079040527344,
        802.0169067382812,
        556.809326171875,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "Annex 1. Guideline development methods 151",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}